{"summary":"Slay - A game of pure strategy","description":"Slay is a simple to learn game of strategy and cunning set in medieval times. The island is divided up between the six players, and you must try to capture your enemies' land and link up your own territories to create larger and stronger ones. You begin capturing land by attacking with your peasants. Once your territories become richer you can combine peasants to make stronger and stronger people (Spearmen, Knights and then Barons) who can kill weaker enemy troops, or knock down their castles. Just be careful that you don't create too many expensive men or the territory will go bankrupt!","esrbNotes":"Violent References","pegiNotes":"Mild Violence","iapPrices":"$10.00 per item","video":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/utkewN6tz6s?vq=large&rel=0&autohide=1&showinfo=0","header":"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/jnRBjYyNuDQzevYefbYPot5229sOgVNOFLwaRGsyUNRFWNQ9kIvj0SlyYN5_PViPn-6EOTslm9pUAIPkrCmLFA","screenshots":["https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/4L8O9bu5GrIXI3AzD3cC8rynUrsW_z0HXGaSjUNosVuh1WLvS-66yKEWWP1xBG2BtQjqzHNQBVmPv4n778Fs5A","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/gTyIqkDeCrWNx-SeGy6PD_3k6EeCYTMnZOakpZy72Tve1mcZYJn-D3kCv8KMgYQh53CnzbkSUfo5q9ylil4xlw","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/FxrJkFE0L-S-PfIouk8NttbYHJUE6rlRsS9l_Px8YSt5OCCvzOKCAjJ5dJ2V6xljTXaUXVqCZF2AHQ7wpJAJQg","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/ELmTHsuUgCZ9cZenzs7_pxzprT4xRKmkyJC3513NK-mBt5KCxAYFvTceAI0fcYOBcdGpi9W5t0aSAsyKD0ix","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/ADRNsJRvEOiLn0CvVyBafwijR82yHgX4XCdvjFa367yLmdjzuBWpn4xt1cYFUb71f7tiUOFRsJnpjV6S_cGz3A","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/wsw_r2q1i99si3G2Ptun4G_gozeX9_iuhj7K-1QpoOb68pwj94aDDFYpRvLCqZSCb3OIvzRhEpPeyD_9XKxQ","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/SZTr9KD9l1lSeMNDxjmg3L13DevuAzJVXxGF66VWZ16Ju_RU1KYSW-QFq1tAVZPaITnh2A0_1zhGUghakRrXMA","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/AJ5HAGJaJJWtYZWtibwlud272SMRXt_BYUCBKsN1_EV7mukjhhyAMvvn2pMG_hawDf3a2zXSUaPq4W1exbq1vQ","h